            [decided: user 2026-11-19] `Shop/Subscription` stays as built (its catalog reason is the test's need and
            `Due` sends no `Start`; renewals never come due in generated runs, so its persisted rows are hand Stories).
        comment     2026-11-19T06:53:08Z
            [decided: agent orchestrator 2026-11-19] The guard is one count per admitted event, shared by every turn its
            context update reaches: sends from onContext turns count and are refused, the onContext events themselves
            never count (D13 stands; R13 reworded). Why: the close review's blocker, each onContext turn of a send-less
